ust been appointed group leader at the Grenoble Criminal Squad when Clara's murder case lands on his desk. Vivés and his team investigate Clara's complex life and relations, but what starts as a professional and methodical immersion into the victim's life soon turns into a haunting obsession.","tagline":"Some crimes will haunt you."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"À la PJ chaque enquêteur tombe un jour ou l’autre sur un crime qu’il n’arrive pas à résoudre et qui le hante. Pour Yohan c’est le meurtre de Clara. Les interrogatoires se succèdent, les suspects ne manquent pas, et les doutes de Yohan ne cessent de grandir. Une seule chose est certaine, le crime a eu lieu la nuit du 12.","tagline":"Il y a des crimes qui vous hantent..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5raDSnE42XhahvE0J8VsuND9SOw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gCOe0ZSGgfsHob7gdg2xQANwTAD.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":925102,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5raDSnE42XhahvE0J8VsuND9SOw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5raDSnE42XhahvE0J8VsuND9SOw.jpg","language":"it","width":1333,"height":1999},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5raDSnE42XhahvE0J8VsuND9SOw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5raDSnE42XhahvE0J8VsuND9SOw.jpg","language":"it","width":1333,"height":1999},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pWRpZBVgaaS9XxjAWUG2NVZNA5m.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pWRpZBVgaaS9XxjAWUG2NVZNA5m.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9IHnpje2aZ6TI6B385BqGfhcMuB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9IHnp